extends layout

block content
  .header_top
    marquee(direction='left')
      | This website has been designed to support the dental education and
      | provide a community platform for students to connect with fellow
      | students and professionals in the field.

  if (logoutStatus === "logoutDone")
    .profile-logged-out
      div Logged Out Successfully!

  .main-container
    #content_upper
      video(autoplay='true', loop='true', muted)
          source(src='/static/img/website/dental-clinician-main-background.mp4', type='video/mp4')
      #hero-text-container
        h1 EMPOWERING 
          span#auto-typed
        h2 The Ultimate Destination for Dental Students and Professionals
      .bottom-arrow
    .content_middle
      #dr-molar-ai-home-container
        img#dr-molar-ai-home-img(src='/static/img/website/dr-molar-ai-home.png' alt="Dr. Molar AI")
        #dr-molar-ai-home-content
          div
            home-hl MEET 
            | Dr. Molar AI - Self Diagnosis Tool
          span Want to get your Dental e-OPD done by our Artificial Intelligence
          button
            a(href='/dr-molar_ai') Start Now
      .dr-molar-ai-details
        h2 Transforming Dental Care with Technology
        p At Dr. Molar AI, we believe in making dental health assessment accessible and convenient. Our platform empowers users to self-assess dental conditions through an intuitive process, generating electronic OPD reports with accurate diagnoses and treatment recommendations—all at no cost.

        h3 How it Works
        .how-it-works-container
          .how-it-works
            img(src='/static/img/website/ai-answer-questions.png' alt="Answer Questions")
            div Answer Questions
            p Complete a comprehensive questionnaire covering chief complaints, history of present illness, medical history, allergies, personal history, and clinical features.
          .how-it-works
            img(src='/static/img/website/ai-diagnosis.png' alt="AI Diagnosis")
            div AI Diagnosis
            p Our advanced artificial intelligence analyzes your responses to provide a detailed and accurate diagnosis.
          .how-it-works
            img(src='/static/img/website/instant-opd-report.png' alt="Instant OPD Report")
            div Instant OPD Report
            p Receive a personalized electronic OPD report, including treatment recommendations, directly to your inbox.

        h3 Dr. Molar AI Uniqueness
        .dr-molar-ai-uniqueness-container
          .dr-molar-ai-uniqueness
            img(src='/static/img/website/personalised-care.png' alt="Personalized Care")
            div Personalized Care
            p Access treatment recommendations tailored to your unique dental profile.
          .dr-molar-ai-uniqueness
            img(src='/static/img/website/user-friendly-platform.png' alt="User-friendly Platform")
            div User-friendly Platform
            p Access our bilingual easy-to-understand Dr. Molar AI on mobile anytime—without Signing up.
          .dr-molar-ai-uniqueness
            img(src='/static/img/website/chatbot-support.png' alt="24/7 Chatbot Support")
            div 24/7 Chatbot Support
            p Engage with our Website Chatbot manned by experienced dental clinicians for immediate assistance and guidance.
      button
        a(href='/dr-molar_ai') Begin Self-Assessment Now

